WEBVTT

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:06.577
Setting up book categories

00:00:06.627 --> 00:00:11.261
Open Library and Catalog, then press Manage Categories.

00:00:21.107 --> 00:00:24.386
Type the category name and a short description.

00:00:36.092 --> 00:00:40.376
Press Add Category. It appears in the list below.

00:00:42.003 --> 00:00:47.861
Press Edit next to a category to change its name or description, then Save Changes.

00:01:00.608 --> 00:01:06.697
Press Done. The categories now appear in the catalog filter and the Add Book form.

00:01:09.465 --> 00:01:14.133
Categories ready
